# AI Tech — environment variables
# Phase 1 (static site) needs none of these. Variables below unlock Phase 2+
# features (auth, database, analytics). Never commit real secrets.

# ---- Phase 2: auth ----
# Secret used to sign session cookies (required in production). Generate:
#   openssl rand -base64 32   (or `npx auth secret`)
# Local dev falls back to a fixed dev secret when unset, so the site works
# out of the box — set a real value before any public deploy.
AUTH_SECRET=

# ---- Phase 2: auth (optional) ----
# "Sign in with Google" button on /login and /register. Create an OAuth 2.0
# client of type "Web application" in Google Cloud Console:
#   https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Add "http://localhost:3000" to Authorized JavaScript origins (and your
# production domain). Copy the client ID here — the button appears only when
# this is set.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Required for the server-side OAuth2 redirect flow (the button redirects to
# accounts.google.com and the callback exchanges the code for an ID token).
# Same Google Cloud Console → the client page shows "Client secret".
# Also add BOTH redirect URIs below to "Authorized redirect URIs" in the console:
#   http://localhost:3000/api/auth/google/callback
#   https://ai-tech.fit/api/auth/google/callback
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

# ---- Phase 2: email verification (Resend) ----
# Free transactional email for the registration confirmation link.
# Create a key at https://resend.com (free tier: 3,000 emails/month) and
# verify your domain (ai-tech.fit) in the Resend dashboard — that adds DNS
# records in Cloudflare. The sender below must be on that domain.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the "from" address (must be a verified domain).
# EMAIL_FROM="AI Tech <no-reply@ai-tech.fit>"
# Optional: base URL used inside the verification link (defaults to site.url).
# APP_URL="https://ai-tech.fit"

# ---- Phase 2: database ----
# Cloudflare D1 is configured in wrangler.jsonc — no env var required.
# For a Postgres alternative, provide a pooled connection string:
# DATABASE_URL=

# ---- Phase 3: analytics / monetization ----
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ADSENSE_CLIENT=

# ---- Newsletter provider (Phase 3) ----
# NEWSLETTER_API_KEY=
# NEWSLETTER_LIST_ID=
